  "content": "<h2><span style=\"color:#008080;font-size:18px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Hh0aDEH.png\" width=\"654\" height=\"102\"></span></h2><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;color:#f60\"><strong>此模組已封存，將不再接收更新。</strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong>Netherific（亦稱 Phantasmic）是一款適用於 1.18.2+ 版本的地獄擴展模組</strong>，旨在比 Mojang 在地獄更新中更深入地擴展地獄內容。它透過新機制、生物、物品、方塊等元素豐富現有所有地獄生態域，同時保持原版風格。</span></p><p>&nbsp;undefined</p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#008000\">部分版本需要 <a style=\"color:#008000\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/geckolib\" rel=\"nofollow\">Geckolib</a>&nbsp;支援</span></span></p><h2><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/5gz1HRz.png\" alt=\"\"></strong></span></h2><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><strong style=\"font-size:14px\">總計 50+ 種新方塊，多數為裝飾性方塊，少數具獨特功能。</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong>新增地獄相關食物，如鬼椒、真菌燉湯、幽靈豬肉、疣豬獸肉等<br></strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong>以全新設計重現舊版 Pocket Edition 的地獄反應核心。<br></strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong>為靈魂砂谷新增幽靈系生物</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong>新增靈魂鍛造機制，可將特定主世界與地獄物品轉化為更具「靈魂特質」的物品。</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong>透過靈魂鍛造打造的全新獨特工具組</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong>擴展現有所有地獄生態域，新增裝飾物、方塊與物品。<br></strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong>部分功能可透過設定檔與遊戲規則調整！</strong></span></li>\n</ul><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#999\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><em><strong>—多數功能僅在最新版本中提供—</strong></em></span></span>&nbsp;</span>&nbsp;</p><h2><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/6elVHBo.png\" width=\"657\" height=\"103\"></span></h2><blockquote>\n<blockquote>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>「Phantasmic 會向下相容 X 版本嗎？」</strong></span></p>\n</blockquote>\n</blockquote><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">僅會向下相容至 1.18.2 版本。</span></p><blockquote>\n<blockquote>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>「Phantasmic 會移植到 Fabric 嗎？」</strong></span></p>\n</blockquote>\n</blockquote><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">不會。</span></p><blockquote>\n<blockquote>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>「我可以在模組包中使用 Phantasmic 嗎？」</strong></span></p>\n</blockquote>\n</blockquote><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">當然可以！若能標註模組出處或提供連結將不勝感激，但並非必要。</span></p><blockquote>\n<blockquote>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>「我可以在哪裡提供翻譯或協助模組翻譯？」</strong></span></p>\n</blockquote>\n</blockquote><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">您可透過此連結翻譯模組：<span style=\"color:#008080\"><a style=\"color:#008080\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcrowdin.com%252fproject%252fenlightenedend\" rel=\"nofollow\">點此進入</a></span></span></p><h2><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/puT4msz.png\" alt=\"\"></strong></span></h2><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong>YouTube 頻道</strong>請至 <span style=\"color:#930\"><a style=\"color:#930\" href=\"https://youtube.com/c/muffinsqw\" rel=\"nofollow\">此處</a></span> 觀看</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>社群 Discord 伺服器</strong>請至 </span><span style=\"color:#36f\"><a style=\"color:#36f\" href=\"https://discord.gg/Ebcqkp8vpC\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">此處</span></a><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 加入 — <em>（加入可搶先體驗內容並獲得支援！）</em></span></span></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#000;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">若想<strong>贊助</strong>，我的 <strong>Ko-Fi</strong> 連結為 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fmuffinsqw\" rel=\"nofollow\">此處</a><br></span></li>\n</ul><h2><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/3ZuBUP6.png\" alt=\"\"></strong></span></h2><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">使用 MCreator 工具開發</span></li>\n</ul><h2><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/SxncOs7.png\" width=\"658\" height=\"103\"></span></h2>",
